Hello Teya team,

Following our email about the eCommerce API, two things are stopping Vesopa S=
oftware Ltd (company number 17362206, Baglan Innovation Centre, Central Avenu=
e, Baglan, Port Talbot SA12 7AX) from completing our Teya application.

WHAT WE SEE
1. Country list: signed in to the Teya application as info@vesopasoftware.com=
, choosing the country Great Britain (United Kingdom) shows "No data availabl=
e", so we cannot go any further with the application.
2. Live data: on the web, only muzahid@vesopa.com (our developer) can sign in=
, and that is to the sandbox. info@vesopasoftware.com shows no live data at a=
ll.

WHAT WE WOULD LIKE
1. Please enable Great Britain (United Kingdom) for Vesopa Software Ltd's app=
lication, or tell us the right route for a UK company.
2. Please set up info@vesopasoftware.com as the main login for Vesopa Softwar=
e Ltd, with access to live as well as sandbox.
3. Let us know if you need anything else to verify the company; we will send =
it the same day.

ATTACHED FOR VERIFICATION
- OCOM-PI2606112.pdf: our supplier's proforma invoice for the Vesopa tills an=
d receipt printers we supply to venues.

Thank you for your help. We are happy to share a screen on a call if that is =
quicker: +44 1792 316282.

Meirion Davies
Director, Vesopa Software Ltd
info@vesopasoftware.com | +44 1792 316282
